- content_for :page_title, "Webhooks"
%h1.visually-hidden Webhooks

.d-flex.justify-content-between.align-items-center.flex-wrap.gap-2.mb-3
  %p.text-muted.mb-0
    Cadastre uma URL pra ser avisado (Slack, Teams, Discord) ou disparar uma automação (n8n, Knime) sempre que um dos eventos abaixo acontecer.
  = link_to "Novo webhook", new_webhook_subscription_path, class: "btn btn-tk-primary text-nowrap"

.table-responsive.tk-card
  %table.table.table-hover.align-middle
    %thead
      %tr
        %th URL
        %th Eventos
        %th Status
        %th Cadastrado por
        %th.text-end Ações
    %tbody
      - @webhook_subscriptions.each do |webhook_subscription|
        %tr
          %td.text-break= webhook_subscription.url
          %td
            - Array(webhook_subscription.events).each do |event|
              %span.badge.tk-badge-executor.me-1= event
          %td
            - if webhook_subscription.active?
              %span.badge.tk-badge-status-concluida Ativo
            - else
              %span.badge.tk-badge-status-pendente Pausado
          %td= webhook_subscription.user.name
          %td.text-end
            .d-flex.gap-2.justify-content-end
              = link_to "Editar", edit_webhook_subscription_path(webhook_subscription), class: "btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
              = button_to "Excluir", webhook_subscription_path(webhook_subscription), method: :delete,
                class: "btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger",
                form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Tem certeza que deseja excluir este webhook?" } }

    - if @webhook_subscriptions.empty?
      %tbody
        %tr
          %td.text-muted{ colspan: 5 }
            Nenhum webhook cadastrado ainda.
